<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank allots 11.44 bln ats in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank allots 11.44 bln ats in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it was allocating 11.44 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed and unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 11 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 15.75 billion schillings in repos, filling 16 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +43- 531 12 256</p>
